{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"8501724_(0046-0152沉陷區披光伏 戈壁綠電送萬家 - 截图4\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-vod-cdn.tvb.com/3f3f683a4ed94949802e4b165ac0edcf/snapshots/837b8e69bf22468f9886d73bffe4db81-00004.jpg\"/><br/> </p><br/></p><p></p><p>本集帶大家來到內蒙古自治區北部的鄂爾多斯高原。這片土地經過生態修復，曾經退化的礦區正轉型為太陽能農場。</p><p></p><p>一排排的太陽能板，鋪展在昔日的採煤沉陷區上。太陽能板為國家提供潔淨新能源，板下長出青草，同時支持生態恢復與綠色發展。</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"8501724_(0046-0152沉陷區披光伏 戈壁綠電送萬家 - 截图6\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-vod-cdn.tvb.com/3f3f683a4ed94949802e4b165ac0edcf/snapshots/837b8e69bf22468f9886d73bffe4db81-00006.jpg\"/><br/> </p><br/></p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T00:18:59.236029+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T00:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T07:37:54.952285+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T00:17:34.463341+00:00","content_hash":"8059eadc023c5a785447aeb51bac18e0c5fd4123db9bb430801a2ef2bbc7ff9d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}